ist"},{"text":"Project Engineer"},{"text":"Technical Lead"}]},{"type":"h","text":"10+ Years"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible paths:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principal Automation Engineer"},{"text":"Automation Architect"},{"text":"Engineering Manager"},{"text":"Controls Manager"},{"text":"Automation Project Manager"},{"text":"Head of Industrial Automation"}]}]},{"heading":"Long-Term Relevance: 2030–2046","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Automation engineering is moving toward increasingly connected and autonomous factories."},{"type":"p","text":"Important areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted automation"},{"text":"Industrial AI"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Autonomous production"},{"text":"Collaborative robots"},{"text":"Machine vision"},{"text":"Industrial edge computing"},{"text":"IIoT"},{"text":"Cloud-connected manufacturing"},{"text":"Predictive maintenance"},{"text":"Autonomous mobile robots"},{"text":"Human-machine collaboration"},{"text":"Software-defined manufacturing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future profile will combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Industrial Control","Robotics","Software","Data","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"However, foundational knowledge of PLC logic, control systems, sensors, actuators and industrial safety remains essential."},{"type":"p","text":"Technology adoption should be based on actual industry requirements."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Automation Core"},{"type":"flow","items":["PLC","HMI","SCADA","Industrial Control"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Hardware"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sensors","Actuators","Motors","Drives","Pneumatics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Robotics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Robot Programming","Robot Integration","End Effectors"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"flow","items":["PROFINET","EtherNet/IP","Modbus","OPC UA","MQTT"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Control"},{"type":"flow","items":["PID","Motion Control","Feedback Systems"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"flow","items":["Python","SQL","Power BI","IIoT","MES"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering"},{"type":"flow","items":["Electrical Drawings","CAD","Troubleshooting","System Integration"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"flow","items":["Commissioning","Documentation","Problem Solving","Safety"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Final Portfolio Target","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, aim to have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PLC-controlled conveyor system"},{"text":"HMI/SCADA project"},{"text":"Automated tank/process-control project"},{"text":"Robot-PLC integration project"},{"text":"Industrial communication project"},{"text":"Machine-vision inspection project"},{"text":"IIoT/OPC UA or MQTT project"},{"text":"Industrial automation internship"},{"text":"Automation troubleshooting case study"},{"text":"Complete smart manufacturing capstone"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Graduate Profile"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Tech/B.E. Robotics & Automation Engineering → Electronics & Controls → PLC → HMI/SCADA → Industrial Networking → Drives → Robotics → Machine Vision → IIoT/MES → Industrial Internship → System Integration → Automation Engineer"}]}]}